# Captured snapshots from scripts/mobile-diag-capture.js — each ~600KB,
# generated per harness run, only useful as transient debugging output.
# Worth-keeping captures of public / synthetic audio may be promoted into a
# permanent measurement file under measurements/<topic>-<date>.json with a
# .md describing the repro. Live-mic captures of the user's own voice are
# private: never promote them into measurements/ (see CLAUDE.md "Private
# session data" and "Mobile diag capture harness").
*.json
!.gitignore
